om september the 15th 2018 to the 15th  of january  2020 and the nominees are  premier kickboxing newton abbott  waggle events limited horsemanship  for health let's see what they've done  to get this far  [Music]  premier kickboxing newton abbott  opened in october 2018 the team at  premier kickboxing have quickly  established themselves as a leading  family-driven martial arts club in the  uk  moving their family from london was a  huge risk for them both they knew no one  and have already established member  numbers in excess of 260 to date simply  through word of mouth  their involvement already in local  community projects is staggering  supporting numerous charities and events  they're heavily involved in  anti-bullying campaigns and work closely  with re-org who work with ex-service men  and women introducing them into martial  arts for their mental health and  well-being when medically discharged  from the service  without doubt premiere kickboxing newton  abbott has saved lives  many of us would now be completely lost  without premier kickboxing and this is  all thanks to stuart and neula mcdowell  who've given up everything for this club  waggle events limited waggle is a  business with a social enterprise  approach  they invest profits into subsidies for  charity clients to whom we offer  subsidised rates and a donation from a  profit share scheme since starting up in  2016 they've supported a variety of  local charities to help them host  fundraising events  by their nature community fundraising  initiatives tend to be sports based and  involve the coming together of large  groups of people  waggle sets out to help charities to run  events that are every bit as  professional and enjoyable to experience  as the most high budget corporate  functions  the profit share fund totaled just over  1500 pounds and was shared between  charities nominated by their corporate  customers  in february 2020 their profit share  figure has increased to over 2  800 pounds h